  "title": "Rita's Spinach Casserole",
  "description": "This is a quick and delicious way to get kids to eat spinach! Ground beef and tomato sauce are layered in a casserole with spinach and mozzarella cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "KSBEESON"
  ],
